<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to Jan 30 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to Jan 30 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $1.000 trillion in the week to January 30 from $1.070 trillion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     54.63		49.43</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     28.78		25.45</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  945.54	    1020.57</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    218.01	     823.08</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	743.06	     787.81</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    257.00	     281.86</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
